[CHANGE] benchmark_1/parts/dag_engine/lib/dag_engine_impl.py: Replaced all raise DAGCancelledError/DAGTimeoutError in wave loop with flag-based early exit (_early_exit). Between-waves cancellation/timeout now set flag and break instead of raising. Per-future cancellation checks set _early_exit and break. Retry loop timeout and cancellation use _early_exit/break. Outer except DAGTimeoutError/DAGCancelledError blocks clean up executor and set _early_exit=True instead of re-raising, allowing fallthrough to report-building code. This ensures runner.run() returns DAGRunReport with CANCELLED nodes rather than propagating exceptions.
